        </div>
        <div class="pain-strips">
          <div class="pain-strip"><span class="strip-index">✓</span><strong>口头完成</strong><span>AI 声称全部完成，代码缺少关键逻辑。</span></div>
          <div class="pain-strip"><span class="strip-index">!</span><strong>假实现</strong><span>有按钮有页面，但只有 alert 或静态假数据。</span></div>
          <div class="pain-strip"><span class="strip-index">−</span><strong>漏需求</strong><span>用户要求 A/B/C/D，只做了 A/B。</span></div>
          <div class="pain-strip"><span class="strip-index">+</span><strong>需求外加戏</strong><span>用户没要求登录，AI 加了复杂认证系统。</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="workflow">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>三步完成 AI 交付验收</h2>
        <p class="section-note">把需求、AI 自述和代码证据放在同一个检查坐标系里。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-grid">
        <article class="card input-card"><div class="input-title">原始需求 <span class="badge-mini">USER</span></div><p class="mock-text">请做一个待办清单应用：
1. 支持新增任务
2. 支持删除任务
3. 支持标记完成
4. 刷新后数据不丢失
5. 手机端正常显示</p></article>
        <article class="card input-card"><div class="input-title">AI 完成说明 <span class="badge-mini">AI CLAIM</span></div><p class="mock-text">已完成所有功能，包括任务增删改查、localStorage 数据保存和响应式布局。</p></article>
        <article class="card input-card"><div class="input-title">最终代码 <span class="badge-mini">CODE</span></div><pre><span class="keyword">function</span> addTodo(text) {
  setTodos([
    ...todos,
    { id: Date.now(), text }
  ]);
}

<span class="keyword">function</span> deleteTodo(id) {
  setTodos(todos.filter(
    item =&gt; item.id !== id
  ));
}</pre></article>
      </div>
      <div class="analysis-bar"><span>拆解需求</span><span>扫描代码</span><span>匹配证据</span></div>
      <div class="flow-output">→ 生成兑现率报告</div>
