    <section class="reveal" id="report">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>模拟检测报告</h2>
        <p class="section-note">每一项判断都连接到需求来源、AI 承诺和代码证据。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="overview">
        <article class="card stat main"><span>需求兑现率</span><strong>40%</strong></article>
        <div class="stat-grid">
          <article class="card stat"><span>已兑现</span><strong>2 项</strong></article>
          <article class="card stat"><span>未兑现</span><strong>3 项</strong></article>
          <article class="card stat"><span>AI 承诺未兑现</span><strong>2 项</strong></article>
          <article class="card stat"><span>需求外加戏</span><strong>1 项</strong></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="table-shell">
        <div class="report-chrome"><div class="chrome-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="chrome-title">DoneCheck Report</div></div>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>需求项</th><th>来源</th><th>状态</th><th>代码证据</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>支持新增任务</td><td class="source">用户需求</td><td><span class="pill ok">已兑现</span></td><td class="evidence">addTodo()、onSubmit</td><td>已发现新增逻辑</td></tr>
            <tr><td>支持删除任务</td><td class="source">用户需求</td><td><span class="pill ok">已兑现</span></td><td class="evidence">deleteTodo(id)</td><td>已发现删除逻辑</td></tr>
            <tr><td>支持标记完成</td><td class="source">用户需求</td><td><span class="pill bad">未兑现</span></td><td class="evidence">未发现 completed 或 toggleComplete</td><td>缺少完成状态</td></tr>
            <tr><td>刷新后数据不丢失</td><td class="source">用户需求 + AI 承诺</td><td><span class="pill bad">未兑现</span></td><td class="evidence">未发现 localStorage</td><td>AI 承诺未兑现</td></tr>
            <tr><td>手机端正常显示</td><td class="source">用户需求 + AI 承诺</td><td><span class="pill weak">证据不足</span></td><td class="evidence">未发现 @media</td><td>需要人工确认</td></tr>
            <tr><td>登录入口</td><td class="source">需求外加戏</td><td><span class="pill extra">加戏</span></td><td class="evidence">LoginButton、LoginPage</td><td>用户未要求登录</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>AI 承诺 vs 代码事实</h2></div>
      <div class="compare">
        <article class="card compare-card">
          <div class="compare-list">
            <div class="compare-row head"><div>AI 声称完成</div><div>代码实际</div><div>状态</div></div>
            <div class="compare-row"><div>已支持 localStorage</div><div>未搜索到 localStorage</div><div class="mark-red">✗ 未兑现</div></div>
            <div class="compare-row"><div>已完成响应式布局</div><div>未发现媒体查询</div><div class="mark-red">✗ 证据不足</div></div>
            <div class="compare-row"><div>已实现增删改查</div><div>有新增和删除，无编辑和完成</div><div class="mark-yellow">△ 部分兑现</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="evidence-map">
            <div class="map-line"></div>
            <div class="map-node">用户需求</div>
            <div class="map-node">AI 承诺</div>
            <div class="map-node">代码证据</div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>DoneCheck 的独特价值</h2></div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="card feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">%</div><h3>需求兑现率</h3><p>把“完成了多少”变成可量化指标。</p></article>
        <article class="card feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">AI</div><h3>AI 承诺核查</h3><p>检查 AI 有没有夸大完成度。</p></article>
